":"Jericho","s":["H3405"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and to "},{"t":"Ai","s":["H5857"],"a":[8]},{"t":","}]},{"n":4,"text":"And so they too acted craftily. And they went out as though they were envoys; and they took old sacks upon their donkeys, and old torn up and bound up wineskins,","tok":[{"t":"And so they too acted craftily. And they "},{"t":"went","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" out as though they were envoys; and they "},{"t":"took","s":["H3947"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"old","s":["H1087"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"sacks","s":["H8242"],"a":[7]},{"t":" upon their donkeys, and "},{"t":"old","s":["H1087"],"a":[12]},{"t":" torn up and bound "},{"t":"up","s":["H6887"],"a":[14]},{"t":" wineskins,"}]},{"n":5,"text":"And old patched sandals on their feet, and old garments upon themselves; and all the bread of their provisions was dry and had become moldy.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"old","s":["H1087"],"a":[1]},{"t":" patched sandals on their "},{"t":"feet","s":["H7272"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"old","s":["H1087"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"garments","s":["H8008"],"a":[4]},{"t":" upon themselves; and all the "},{"t":"bread","s":["H3899"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of their "},{"t":"provisions","s":["H6718"],"a":[9]},{"t":" was "},{"t":"dry","s":["H3001"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and had become moldy."}]},{"n":6,"text":"And they went to Joshua at the camp of Gilgal and said to him and to the men of Israel, From a faraway land we have come; now therefore make a covenant with us.","tok":[{"t":"And they "},{"t":"went","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Joshua","s":["H3091"],"a":[2]},{"t":" at the "},{"t":"camp","s":["H4264"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Gilgal","s":["H1537"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to him and to the "},{"t":"men","s":["H0376"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[10]},{"t":", From a faraway land we have "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[13]},{"t":"; now therefore "},{"t":"make","s":["H3772"],"a":[15]},{"t":" a covenant with us."}]},{"n":7